"pi.bundle-bedrock-client.exclusion.50.60809","FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both","npm:@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent@1.4.0/dist/bundle/chunks/bedrock-converse-stream.js:50","60809","string-literal","""FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both""","static-partition-capability-preemption","SSO GetRoleCredentials generated BDD reaches error result when no custom Endpoint, Region set, UseFIPS and UseDualStack true, but partition supportsFIPS or supportsDualStack nottrue. EndpointError evaluates fixed result text; client/auth region/provider checks can preempt. Ambient SDK FIPS/dualstack/config/customendpoint gates apply; private client alternatives do not imply default invocation. Full local partitionsInfo marks supportsFIPS and supportsDualStack true for every partition, fallback aws also true. No own registration of altered partition data or exported setter; unsupported-capability error requires unestablished internal data replacement.","SSO GetRoleCredentials generated BDD reaches error result when no custom Endpoint, Region set, UseFIPS and UseDualStack true, but partition supportsFIPS or supportsDualStack nottrue. EndpointError evaluates fixed result text; client/auth region/provider checks can preempt. Ambient SDK FIPS/dualstack/config/customendpoint gates apply; private client alternatives do not imply default invocation. Full local partitionsInfo marks supportsFIPS and supportsDualStack true for every partition, fallback aws also true. No own registration of altered partition data or exported setter; unsupported-capability error requires unestablished internal data replacement.","Local bundled helper/class/namespace is private: final ESM exports only stream/streamSimple. Own fixed generated schemas/middleware and normal lifetime preempt this guard, or its only callers are dormant unrelated operations. Exact source prose and local conditions retained; internal mutable state/native runtime interference is not established ordinary publication. Exact outgoing request/model-context prose and argumentsError are observable through onPayload/provider callbacks/direct stream result/model echo when their branch is selected. Request conversion alone does not persist original AgentState/main-systemPrompt/HTML. Optional callbacks and changed caller data remain external boundaries.","Exact source_text_json authoritative; values containing CR and whitespace-only control values JSON-encoded in English column for diff hygiene, without stripping source. Optional/native/foreign/caught publication qualifications do not imply impossible observation.","{""index"":3703,""column"":60809,""kind"":""string-literal"",""raw"":""\""FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both\"""",""start"":594414,""end"":594495,""owner"":""init_bdd2.\""node_modules/@aws-sdk/nested-clients/dist-es/submodules/sso/endpoint/bdd.js\"""",""conditions"":[],""nearest"":{""kind"":""PropertyAssignment"",""source"":""results:[[a2],[a2,\""Invalid Configuration: FIPS and custom endpoint are not supported\""],[a2,\""Invalid Configuration: Dualstack and custom endpoint are not supported\""],[g2,i2],[\""https://portal.sso-fips.{Region}.{PartitionResult#dualStackDnsSuffix}\"",i2],[a2,\""FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both\""],[\""https://portal.sso.{Region}.amazonaws.com\"",i2],[\""https://portal.sso-fips.{Region}.{PartitionResult#dnsSuffix}\"",i2],[a2,\""FIPS is enabled but this partition does not support FIPS\""],[\""https://portal.sso.{Region}.{PartitionResult#dualStackDnsSuffix}\"",i2],[a2,\""DualStack is enabled but this partition does not support DualStack\""],[\""https://portal.sso.{Region}.{PartitionResult#dnsSuffix}\"",i2],[a2,\""Invalid Configuration: Missing Region\""]]"",""line"":50,""column"":60555,""start"":594160,""end"":594932}}"
