"pi.bundle-bedrock-client.exclusion.51.10109","FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both","npm:@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent@1.4.0/dist/bundle/chunks/bedrock-converse-stream.js:51","10109","string-literal","""FIPS and DualStack are enabled, but this partition does not support one or both""","static-partition-capability-preemption","STS AssumeRole/web-identity generated BDD reaches error result when no custom Endpoint, Region set, UseFIPS and UseDualStack true, but partition supportsFIPS or supportsDualStack nottrue. EndpointError evaluates fixed result text; client/auth region/provider checks can preempt. Ambient SDK FIPS/dualstack/config/customendpoint gates apply; private client alternatives do not imply default invocation. Full local partitionsInfo marks supportsFIPS and supportsDualStack true for every partition, fallback aws also true. No own registration of altered partition data or exported setter; unsupported-capability error requires unestablished internal data replacement.","STS AssumeRole/web-identity generated BDD reaches error result when no custom Endpoint, Region set, UseFIPS and UseDualStack true, but partition supportsFIPS or supportsDualStack nottrue. EndpointError evaluates fixed result text; client/auth region/provider checks can preempt. Ambient SDK FIPS/dualstack/config/customendpoint gates apply; private client alternatives do not imply default invocation. Full local partitionsInfo marks supportsFIPS and supportsDualStack true for every partition, fallback aws also true. No own registration of altered partition data or exported setter; unsupported-capability error requires unestablished internal data replacement.","Local bundled helper/class/namespace is private: final ESM exports only stream/streamSimple. Own fixed generated schemas/middleware and normal lifetime preempt this guard, or its only callers are dormant unrelated operations. Exact source prose and local conditions retained; internal mutable s